  nonce: 7fc4  # 7fc4
  message: "SATISFIED on the filed instance (the else_clause of try, for and while). Fix merged in PR #2055 (dev cd6981f779, rebase-merged 2026-11-05; tree b9e46bb56c): LoopMapping and TryCatchMapping gain else_child, cfg_nodes/python.yaml names type:else_clause on while_statement, for_statement and try_statement; _process_loop processes the clause after popping the loop context (a break inside it belongs to the enclosing loop) and routes the header's false edge into it while break edges still join the loop's fringe; _process_try_catch routes the try body's normal fringe through the clause before finally, the handlers' fringes bypassing it; grammars without else_child take the unchanged path (pinned for c/go/java/rust/typescript). Tests: packages/hypergumbo-core/tests/test_cfg.py::TestElseClause (7 tests incl. try-else sees only the try body's definition, for-else not reached from break, a break in a loop-else leaves the enclosing loop), red before (11 failed) and green after (164 passed). BEHAVIOURAL EVIDENCE, the item's own repros re-run on the merged tree (rotol_fix_11042026/repro_merged_b9e46bb56c.txt): try_else uncovered [] (was {7}), 3 edges; try_else_finally uncovered [] (was {17}), 4 edges; for_else uncovered [] (was {6}), 4 edges; while_else uncovered [] (was {15}), 8 edges. Pre-registered measurements (RESULT.md; before at dev 27247f8765, after with the fix, re-measured on the merged tree, merged.json): self-tree forfeit_refutation core 2 -> 0 of 3117 edged functions and mainstream 3 -> 0 of 1566, every one of the five a loop-else or try-else as pre-registered; edges core 173,662 -> 173,923, mainstream 150,439 -> 150,455; unaccounted_names 414 / 224 unchanged; self-claims gate check-self-claims-drift OK, 23 confirmed_with_caveats unchanged; affected run 12,668 passed with 2 failures that were fixtures pinning this very gap (corrected, not relaxed: test_cfg_statement_model un-records the clause to pin the extent cut; test_cli_verify_claims_ddg's non-vacuity floor moves to Go's two-literal binding, WI-rovun). FOUND, not pre-registered: no probed Python shape forfeits refutation any more (sixteen shapes incl. except*, nested decorated def, match guard, async for/with, syntax errors; forfeit_candidates*.txt). The general claim that every clause of every Python compound statement is in the CFG is NOT asserted; this item covers the three else_clause hosts. NOT measured: the corpus A/B on the io-manifest / bakeoff repos (django has 184 such functions)."  # 7fc4
